WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 13=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.070 --> 01:42.790
- Kick your shoes!
- Kick your shoes!

01:42.800 --> 01:45.250
- Drive out sickness and evil!
- Drive out sickness and evil!

01:45.350 --> 01:47.400
- Kick your shoes!
- Kick your shoes!

01:47.410 --> 01:49.750
- Drive out sickness and evil!
- Drive out sickness and evil!

01:49.760 --> 01:50.920
My turn!

01:54.260 --> 01:57.260
(Homemade Pickles)

02:06.056 --> 02:07.480
These are your reed down shoes?

02:08.120 --> 02:08.840
They look nice.

02:09.128 --> 02:10.408
Who made them for you?

02:11.030 --> 02:11.630
My mother.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.280
Here.

02:20.750 --> 02:23.310
♪Needles for sale♪

02:24.136 --> 02:24.730
What's this?

02:24.750 --> 02:27.800
♪Needles for sale♪

02:28.190 --> 02:31.590
♪Embroider flowers, stitch clouds,
make soles, sew shoes♪

02:32.030 --> 02:35.560
♪String peppers, stitch burlap sacks♪

02:35.720 --> 02:37.688
So these are the reed down shoes
you mentioned.

02:39.430 --> 02:41.030
Reed down isn't as warm as cotton,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.560
but for poor families,

02:43.570 --> 02:44.740
in the bitter cold of winter,

02:44.750 --> 02:46.550
having a pair
of reed down shoes like these

02:46.590 --> 02:47.520
is already a blessing.

02:47.730 --> 02:49.830
Poor families tend
to live in the south of the city,

02:49.840 --> 02:51.360
so that's where we should look.

02:52.120 --> 02:54.280
But how do you know those women

02:54.280 --> 02:56.360
would use padded coats
to make reed down shoes?

02:57.470 --> 02:58.840
Those women who used moldy cotton

02:58.840 --> 03:00.680
and reed fluff to make padded coats

03:01.080 --> 03:03.080
knew they were doing
something dishonest,

03:03.240 --> 03:04.470
yet they still did it.

03:04.800 --> 03:06.630
Either their families were poor,

03:06.960 --> 03:08.310
or they were greedy for profit.

03:08.840 --> 03:11.470
Most likely, it was both.

03:13.208 --> 03:14.248
Women like that

03:14.264 --> 03:16.290
are used to saving
and scraping wherever they can.

03:16.400 --> 03:18.000
They'd surely find a way

03:18.310 --> 03:20.590
to sneak out scraps of cloth and thread.

03:20.910 --> 03:22.590
They'd take whatever they could get.

03:23.280 --> 03:25.190
Scraps of cloth, reed down,

03:25.320 --> 03:26.470
and in the middle of winter,

03:26.870 --> 03:29.630
the most practical thing to make
would be reed down shoes.

03:31.280 --> 03:32.190
You're still young,

03:32.600 --> 03:34.190
yet you understand human nature well.

03:37.960 --> 03:39.910
Young Master,
have you ever heard this song?

03:41.400 --> 03:42.870
Snatch mud from a swallow's beak,

03:43.048 --> 03:44.560
shave iron from the tip of a needle,

03:45.710 --> 03:47.910
scrape gold from a Buddha's
face and search every inch.

03:48.120 --> 03:49.688
Find something where there's nothing,

03:50.430 --> 03:52.120
hunt for peas in a quail's crop,

03:52.280 --> 03:54.030
carve lean meat from a heron's leg,

03:54.360 --> 03:56.400
and extract oil from a mosquito's belly.

03:57.030 --> 03:58.520
What ruthless hands you have, sir.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.400
What a biting song.

04:07.128 --> 04:08.990
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

04:09.112 --> 04:11.352
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

04:11.470 --> 04:12.960
sometimes just staying alive

04:13.430 --> 04:15.000
takes everything we have.

04:16.390 --> 04:17.800
If we want to rise above our station

04:17.800 --> 04:19.000
and live a little better,

04:19.600 --> 04:21.310
we may have to abandon our conscience

04:21.870 --> 04:23.000
and risk our lives.

04:25.016 --> 04:26.792
It's not that
I understand people so well.

04:27.310 --> 04:30.040
It's just like those reed down shoes.

04:30.376 --> 04:32.184
You've never seen them before,
Young Master,

04:32.600 --> 04:34.120
but we see them every day.

04:34.248 --> 04:35.896
There's nothing unusual about them.

04:45.976 --> 04:47.600
Though I'd never seen reed down shoes,

04:48.760 --> 04:50.160
I've also done everything I could

04:51.390 --> 04:52.600
just to survive.

04:56.680 --> 05:01.560
♪Rouge, hair ribbons,
combs and fine-toothed combs♪

05:02.040 --> 05:03.310
♪Come and buy♪

05:03.480 --> 05:04.750
♪Take some home♪

05:04.950 --> 05:07.510
♪Every household needs its daily wares♪

05:17.430 --> 05:18.390
Be careful.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.160
The peddler is back.

05:34.920 --> 05:35.870
Young Master is waiting.

05:35.870 --> 05:36.750
Hurry inside.

05:51.190 --> 05:52.160
These didn't sell.

06:12.040 --> 06:12.560
Hua,

06:13.070 --> 06:13.680
try some.

06:17.870 --> 06:18.630
It's so sweet.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.070
Young Master,

06:44.630 --> 06:45.390
we're back.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.040
No rush.

06:48.310 --> 06:48.984
Have some water.

06:49.016 --> 06:50.424
Sit down and tell me everything.

06:51.510 --> 06:51.950
Yes.

06:54.680 --> 06:55.630
While selling my wares,

06:55.640 --> 06:57.528
I struck up a conversation
with Fourth Lady Li,

06:57.530 --> 06:58.568
who makes reed down shoes.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.720
She told me that

06:59.730 --> 07:01.800
before the Chinese New Year,
she'd done some sewing

07:01.800 --> 07:02.968
for a family surnamed Luo.

07:03.800 --> 07:05.120
Following the lead she gave me,

07:05.240 --> 07:06.510
I found the Luo residence.

07:07.070 --> 07:09.070
Not only were their servants
strong and capable,

07:09.190 --> 07:10.290
but they also kept two dogs.

07:10.792 --> 07:11.600
Whenever I got close,

07:11.600 --> 07:12.630
the dogs barked fiercely.

07:12.790 --> 07:15.768
So I could only circle the outside
of the residence for most of the day

07:15.896 --> 07:17.928
until I knew
the surrounding terrain thoroughly.

07:20.536 --> 07:21.912
As you instructed, Young Master,

07:21.920 --> 07:23.750
I asked around
at the city's brokerage houses.

07:23.760 --> 07:26.070
I found that whenever
the Luo family hires mules and horses,

07:26.088 --> 07:27.752
they only hire the animals and carts.

07:27.760 --> 07:29.352
They always provide their own men.

07:30.430 --> 07:31.680
That's highly suspicious.

07:32.390 --> 07:34.750
Lu Dalang is almost certainly
hiding there.

07:35.384 --> 07:37.160
If you hadn't
been suspended, Young Master,

07:37.512 --> 07:39.310
we could bring in
some men from the army,

07:39.720 --> 07:41.560
block the roads
and surround the residence.

07:41.912 --> 07:44.712
They'd be trapped with nowhere to run,
and we'd be sure to catch them.

07:45.430 --> 07:45.750
But...

07:47.040 --> 07:49.720
But with so few of us now,

07:49.730 --> 07:52.480
I'm afraid that while we're still
dealing with the servants out front,

07:52.552 --> 07:55.032
Lu Dalang will have already
escaped through the back.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.920
Young Master has some friends

07:57.920 --> 07:59.270
in the Three Judicial Offices.

08:00.680 --> 08:03.390
Why don't we borrow some constables?

08:05.816 --> 08:07.310
For two or three thousand padded coats

08:07.320 --> 08:08.600
to be replaced with inferior ones

08:08.600 --> 08:10.350
and make their way
into the Shence Garrison,

08:10.360 --> 08:12.040
someone in
the government office must have

08:12.104 --> 08:13.890
been working
with Lu Dalang from the inside.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.830
If we borrow men,

08:15.032 --> 08:16.750
I'm afraid the moment
we step out the door,

08:16.870 --> 08:17.750
Lu Dalang and his men

08:17.750 --> 08:19.064
will already have been tipped off.

08:19.950 --> 08:21.070
Once we fail to catch him,

08:21.704 --> 08:23.660
someone eager
to curry favor with the Zhao family

08:23.680 --> 08:25.560
will surely impeach me
for disregarding the law

08:25.680 --> 08:27.192
and trespassing on private property.

08:27.816 --> 08:29.752
Then not only
will my offense be compounded,

08:29.912 --> 08:31.560
but my friends will also be implicated.

08:32.550 --> 08:34.080
We need to find a way inside

08:34.150 --> 08:35.240
and learn what's going on.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.000
To slip in unnoticed,

08:38.488 --> 08:40.080
we'd have to deal with the dogs first.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.550
But they're extremely vigilant.

08:42.960 --> 08:44.270
They won't even let peddlers near.

08:47.160 --> 08:49.080
Fourth Lady Li,
who makes reed down shoes,

08:49.080 --> 08:50.080
was allowed inside.

08:50.870 --> 08:52.360
Clearly, they're

08:52.790 --> 08:54.120
less wary of women.

09:07.256 --> 09:09.448
I'll disguise myself
as a woman and sneak in.

09:11.112 --> 09:12.600
You'd have to keep your head down

09:12.648 --> 09:14.440
even to fool
the women and children inside.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.870
If you meet anyone vigilant,

09:16.232 --> 09:17.550
they'll see through you at once.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.080
Young Master,

09:31.000 --> 09:31.480
I'll go.

09:42.080 --> 09:44.480
Aren't you afraid?

09:46.808 --> 09:48.600
This is Jinling, the Southern Capital.

09:48.720 --> 09:49.840
It's broad daylight.

09:50.024 --> 09:51.440
I'm only going inside the residence

09:51.440 --> 09:52.550
to see what's going on.

09:53.150 --> 09:54.270
What's there to be afraid of?

09:59.790 --> 10:01.360
If you help us catch Lu Dalang,

10:01.816 --> 10:03.320
you'll be handsomely rewarded.

10:04.080 --> 10:04.870
Remember,

10:05.600 --> 10:07.030
you must not act rashly.

10:07.336 --> 10:08.870
At worst, we'll come away empty-handed

10:09.510 --> 10:10.510
and find another way.

10:13.480 --> 10:14.670
The key is those two dogs.

10:14.776 --> 10:16.320
As long as we keep them from barking,

10:17.080 --> 10:18.840
Nanke and I can

10:18.840 --> 10:20.550
slip inside without anyone noticing.

10:44.408 --> 10:45.440
Who are you looking for?

10:45.840 --> 10:46.630
Sir,

10:47.840 --> 10:51.150
my husband came from
the capital to Jinling on business.

10:51.510 --> 10:53.000
He caught a cold by accident

10:53.000 --> 10:54.390
and never recovered.

10:55.000 --> 10:57.960
We spent all our money,
but he still died.

10:58.870 --> 11:00.550
I truly have nowhere else to turn.

11:00.750 --> 11:01.720
I heard you're hiring

11:01.910 --> 11:03.670
women who can sew.

11:04.510 --> 11:06.320
So I gathered
the courage to come and ask.

11:07.440 --> 11:09.030
Please, sir, have mercy.

11:09.030 --> 11:10.584
Please give me a way to earn my keep.

11:10.840 --> 11:12.080
How good are you at needlework?

11:13.030 --> 11:15.240
I made the clothes I'm wearing myself.

11:17.390 --> 11:19.750
I embroidered the flower
on this handkerchief, too.

11:52.000 --> 11:52.440
Come back.

11:57.870 --> 11:58.440
Let's go.

11:58.910 --> 12:00.248
I'll take you to see the owner.

12:52.550 --> 12:53.550
Wait here.

13:17.360 --> 13:18.550
Greetings, Madam.

13:25.630 --> 13:27.030
The women who worked here before

13:27.030 --> 13:28.240
had sticky fingers.

13:29.720 --> 13:30.870
It's best to check beforehand

13:31.480 --> 13:34.000
so there's no dispute
if anything happens.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.240
Embroider something.

13:41.510 --> 13:42.720
Let's see your skill.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.600
(There's a man inside, too.)

14:06.600 --> 14:08.320
(This woman is just a figurehead.)

14:09.624 --> 14:11.736
(Judging by the state
of the house inside and out,)

14:12.960 --> 14:14.600
(they're about to move away.)

14:38.648 --> 14:40.536
You're no match
for a professional embroiderer,

14:40.870 --> 14:41.840
but your work will do.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.750
What else can you do besides embroidery?

14:48.390 --> 14:49.390
Can you weave?

14:56.910 --> 14:57.750
Madam,

14:58.270 --> 14:59.320
to tell you the truth,

14:59.720 --> 15:02.120
I came today to ask another favor.

15:03.510 --> 15:04.550
After my husband died,

15:04.712 --> 15:06.790
I had no choice
but to rent a place in Kujing Lane.

15:07.200 --> 15:09.080
Fourth Lady Li,
who lives in the same lane,

15:09.270 --> 15:10.630
heard about my situation

15:10.870 --> 15:12.550
and told me you buy cotton here.

15:13.440 --> 15:15.510
My husband was a cotton merchant.

15:17.200 --> 15:20.600
But before he could sell his stock,

15:21.240 --> 15:23.720
he fell ill and passed away.

15:23.912 --> 15:25.630
It's already the second month of spring.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.150
It's getting warmer by the day.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.720
Who would still need cotton now?

15:30.200 --> 15:31.600
But if it's stored properly,

15:32.120 --> 15:33.600
it'll surely sell once the weather

15:33.600 --> 15:34.960
turns cold at year's end.

15:35.630 --> 15:37.320
Please, Madam, have mercy

15:37.320 --> 15:38.790
and buy my family's cotton.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.200
You can name the price.

15:42.080 --> 15:44.750
I only ask for enough
to return to the capital.

16:04.600 --> 16:05.550
This is Lu Dalang.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.150
You really have cotton?

16:13.150 --> 16:14.940
(Lu Dalang, Cotton Merchant)

16:15.550 --> 16:16.360
I do.

16:16.750 --> 16:18.270
Fourth Lady Li can vouch for me.

16:18.960 --> 16:19.840
The house I'm renting

16:19.840 --> 16:21.080
is right next to hers.

16:21.510 --> 16:22.960
When she helped me move the cotton,

16:22.960 --> 16:24.728
she even secretly
kept a little for herself.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.960
Now that my husband is gone,

16:27.016 --> 16:28.700
I'm hardly in a position
to argue over it.

16:28.840 --> 16:30.550
I can only pretend I don't know.

16:32.104 --> 16:34.490
Among the women who worked here
before the Chinese New Year,

16:34.616 --> 16:37.160
there was indeed a Fourth Lady Li
who liked taking things.

16:41.960 --> 16:43.150
Where is your cotton?

16:44.870 --> 16:46.390
At the house I'm renting.

16:46.840 --> 16:48.960
Several rooms are packed full of it.

16:49.480 --> 16:50.960
I'll sell it for next to nothing.

16:51.480 --> 16:53.200
I only need enough for my journey home.

16:58.600 --> 16:59.720
I'm telling the truth.

17:02.488 --> 17:04.880
Have someone rent a mule cart
from the brokerage house.

17:04.968 --> 17:06.310
I'll go with her and take a look.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.200
Yes.

17:55.760 --> 17:56.270
Wait.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.480
Why aren't the dogs barking?

18:05.440 --> 18:06.240
Lazy beasts!

18:06.270 --> 18:07.270
Wake up!

18:12.960 --> 18:14.200
Who came by today?

18:15.550 --> 18:16.310
Other than her,

18:16.310 --> 18:17.110
no one.

18:26.550 --> 18:27.200
Tell me.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.550
Who sent you?

18:29.400 --> 18:30.920
I'm just here to sell cotton.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.160
My husband died...

18:37.440 --> 18:38.400
If you don't come out,

18:39.350 --> 18:41.030
I'll kill this woman!

18:46.110 --> 18:46.720
Come out.

19:06.640 --> 19:08.510
So it's Assistant Commander Lin.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.350
What an honored guest.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.696
Forgive me
for not welcoming you properly!

19:35.550 --> 19:36.350
Lu Dalang,

19:37.030 --> 19:38.110
let her go first.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.480
Assistant Commander Lin,

19:41.590 --> 19:42.750
you step aside first.

19:42.750 --> 19:44.390
As long as I can
get safely into the cart

19:44.408 --> 19:45.432
and leave this place,

19:45.790 --> 19:46.720
I'll let her go.

19:48.830 --> 19:51.830
If I can't get out of here safely today,

19:52.680 --> 19:54.510
this woman dies first.

19:55.640 --> 19:56.440
Move.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.680
Move!

20:07.592 --> 20:09.496
Young Master,
you've lived a life of privilege.

20:10.072 --> 20:12.328
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

20:12.550 --> 20:14.030
sometimes just staying alive

20:14.510 --> 20:16.000
takes everything we have.

20:19.550 --> 20:20.960
If we want to rise above our station

20:20.960 --> 20:22.160
and live a little better,

20:23.880 --> 20:25.590
we may have to abandon our conscience

20:26.160 --> 20:27.350
and risk our lives.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.550
I said move!

20:59.540 --> 21:06.760
♪I no longer blame
the moon for withholding its light♪

21:07.070 --> 21:14.330
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

21:14.750 --> 21:18.990
♪No longer
let the world's wind and snow fall♪

21:18.990 --> 21:21.840
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

21:22.210 --> 21:26.270
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

21:26.410 --> 21:32.460
♪You and I will walk there together♪

22:52.790 --> 22:53.720
With all this commotion,

22:53.730 --> 22:55.310
the men from the Five City Patrol Office

22:55.320 --> 22:56.344
will be here soon.

22:57.030 --> 22:58.110
You can't escape.

22:58.350 --> 22:59.270
Come back with me

22:59.720 --> 23:00.920
and explain everything.

23:01.640 --> 23:03.070
I know you were only an accomplice.

23:03.112 --> 23:04.640
Your crime doesn't warrant death.

23:35.400 --> 23:36.880
Assistant Commander Lin,

23:37.720 --> 23:41.590
it's not that
I couldn't defeat you today.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.720
It's just that

23:44.270 --> 23:48.110
this woman was cunning.

23:49.400 --> 23:50.960
Cunning!

24:29.960 --> 24:30.550
Nanke,

24:31.032 --> 24:33.660
Jiugao and I will go with the men
from the Five City Patrol Office.

24:33.670 --> 24:35.950
Take Lanxiang to a medical hall
to have her wound dressed,

24:35.960 --> 24:36.696
and send her back.

24:37.270 --> 24:37.640
Yes.

24:59.180 --> 25:02.020
(Liu Xiaochuan, Sixth-Rank Commander
of the Southern City Patrol Office)

25:02.030 --> 25:04.000
A young maid
really stabbed him with this?

25:06.000 --> 25:08.070
That girl is ruthless.

25:08.110 --> 25:08.790
If word gets out,

25:08.790 --> 25:09.920
who would dare marry her?

25:09.920 --> 25:10.680
Just looking at it

25:10.680 --> 25:11.720
makes me shudder.

25:11.750 --> 25:12.880
Look.

25:13.350 --> 25:14.590
Whoever marries a wife like that

25:14.590 --> 25:16.248
would never dare visit a pleasure house.

25:22.310 --> 25:24.200
Lu Dalang was tough, too.

25:25.070 --> 25:26.510
He had a needle stuck in him

25:27.480 --> 25:28.720
and could still fight me.

25:29.830 --> 25:31.110
He didn't seem like a merchant.

25:32.440 --> 25:35.200
Merchants who travel far and wide
can put profit above all else.

25:35.200 --> 25:37.192
Sometimes they're
even more ruthless than bandits.

25:37.200 --> 25:39.130
How else could
they make a fortune in business?

25:39.144 --> 25:39.816
Gloves.

26:20.872 --> 26:23.240
What's so interesting
about these calluses?

26:38.070 --> 26:39.110
When he took his own life,

26:39.110 --> 26:40.248
did he cut across the wound?

26:40.270 --> 26:42.110
The fatal wound
was indeed a horizontal cut

26:42.312 --> 26:43.790
before the blade was thrust deeper.

27:13.640 --> 27:14.270
Young Master.

27:17.510 --> 27:19.750
The physician said
the flesh wound is nothing serious.

27:20.210 --> 27:21.220
With some topical medicine

27:21.230 --> 27:22.400
and proper rest, it'll heal.

27:22.660 --> 27:24.090
But he was concerned about the shock,

27:24.100 --> 27:25.860
so he prescribed something
to calm the mind.

27:25.870 --> 27:28.216
It should be taken for five days
before seeing how things go.

27:40.480 --> 27:41.110
Let me.

27:43.350 --> 27:43.960
Easy.

27:55.590 --> 27:56.680
Lie down and rest.

27:57.480 --> 27:59.544
Young Master doesn't care
about such formalities.

28:01.310 --> 28:01.960
How are you?

28:02.510 --> 28:03.270
Can you talk?

28:07.064 --> 28:08.550
My head just feels a little heavy.

28:08.872 --> 28:10.000
Once I've taken the medicine

28:10.000 --> 28:11.550
and had a good sleep, I'll be fine.

28:11.832 --> 28:13.480
If you have questions, Young Master,

28:13.590 --> 28:14.400
just ask.

28:14.960 --> 28:15.960
I can talk.

28:17.510 --> 28:19.720
I want to know what happened

28:19.790 --> 28:21.160
after you entered the residence.

28:23.928 --> 28:25.170
It concerns the investigation.

28:25.310 --> 28:27.160
Tell me everything,
no matter how trivial.

28:33.880 --> 28:35.030
After entering the residence,

28:35.550 --> 28:37.110
I did as Jiugao taught me.

28:37.400 --> 28:40.270
I found a way to toss
the drugged handkerchief

28:40.270 --> 28:41.920
into the dogs' drinking water.

28:42.270 --> 28:44.400
Then I followed
a servant farther inside.

28:45.920 --> 28:48.510
I noticed the plants around
the residence were withered,

28:48.920 --> 28:50.590
but the servants were well dressed.

28:51.000 --> 28:53.240
The two large dogs
were also strong and healthy.

28:54.310 --> 28:54.960
That showed

28:55.830 --> 28:57.070
the owner wasn't short of money.

28:57.752 --> 28:59.510
He simply didn't
regard that place as home.

28:59.750 --> 29:01.590
It was only a temporary hideout.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.550
That made it even more likely

29:04.632 --> 29:05.960
that Lu Dalang was hiding there.

29:07.310 --> 29:10.720
I also noticed the east
and west wings were shut tight.

29:10.856 --> 29:12.510
The main house was sparsely furnished.

29:13.830 --> 29:15.960
That suggested
they'd either just moved in

29:16.310 --> 29:18.680
or were about to leave soon.

29:19.550 --> 29:21.750
I knew you were eager to catch Lu Dalang

29:21.960 --> 29:23.480
and couldn't let him escape.

29:23.960 --> 29:24.960
In desperation,

29:25.350 --> 29:27.720
I came up with a plan,
though it wasn't much of one.

29:28.270 --> 29:29.400
I took a chance and said

29:30.110 --> 29:32.000
I had a stockpile of cotton to sell.

29:39.510 --> 29:40.856
Lu Dalang even wanted the cotton

29:40.860 --> 29:42.744
from the Shence Garrison's padded coats,

29:43.110 --> 29:46.440
so clearly he was greedy for cotton.

29:47.920 --> 29:50.550
Birds die for food, and men for wealth.

29:51.310 --> 29:53.880
Lu Dalang had
been hiding in the inner room,

29:54.088 --> 29:55.510
but the moment he heard I had cotton,

29:55.590 --> 29:56.720
he came out.

29:57.640 --> 29:59.240
When he saw I was a widow,

29:59.310 --> 30:01.048
he thought
he could take advantage of me,

30:01.720 --> 30:03.720
so he wanted to come
with me to see the cotton.

30:06.110 --> 30:08.510
Where did you get that needle?

30:14.000 --> 30:16.720
Lu Dalang's wife
wanted to see my needlework.

30:16.968 --> 30:18.552
She brought out a needle and thread

30:18.584 --> 30:20.008
and asked me to embroider something.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.240
At the time, I suspected

30:22.960 --> 30:25.350
Lu Dalang was in the inner room.

30:26.040 --> 30:27.480
I wasn't sure what might happen,

30:27.590 --> 30:29.448
so I took the opportunity
to hide a needle

30:30.110 --> 30:31.510
in case I needed it.

30:33.070 --> 30:33.920
I never expected

30:35.070 --> 30:36.440
I'd actually have to use it.

30:40.240 --> 30:41.070
Apart from that,

30:41.928 --> 30:44.104
is there anything else
you want to tell me?

30:46.632 --> 30:49.110
The servants knew there were
women in the inner quarters,

30:49.270 --> 30:50.840
yet they came and went as they pleased.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.440
The madam of the house

30:52.510 --> 30:53.920
wasn't bothered by it at all.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.352
The masters didn't act like masters,

30:55.360 --> 30:57.064
and the servants
didn't act like servants.

30:57.270 --> 30:58.510
Even a merchant household

30:58.590 --> 31:00.160
wouldn't be so lacking in propriety.

31:01.240 --> 31:02.270
That woman

31:03.160 --> 31:05.110
probably wasn't Lu Dalang's wife.

31:05.750 --> 31:06.590
Lu Dalang

31:07.550 --> 31:08.920
didn't seem like a merchant.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.510
Young Master,

31:34.480 --> 31:36.480
did I get something wrong?

31:41.048 --> 31:42.200
Everything you said was right.

31:43.064 --> 31:44.070
I promised you before

31:44.088 --> 31:46.390
that you'd be handsomely rewarded
if we caught Lu Dalang.

31:47.000 --> 31:48.030
What would you like?

31:53.310 --> 31:56.480
I can't think of anything
I want right now.

31:56.920 --> 31:57.720
Why don't I

31:57.790 --> 31:59.510
save up the favor for now?

31:59.830 --> 32:00.720
Once I've decided,

32:00.720 --> 32:02.030
I'll ask you for something.

32:04.920 --> 32:05.480
All right.

32:06.440 --> 32:08.590
Come to me once you've decided.

32:10.808 --> 32:12.328
Take good care of Lanxiang.

32:12.392 --> 32:14.350
The fewer people
who know Lanxiang was injured,

32:14.360 --> 32:15.550
the better.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.920
Don't let her parents hear about it.

32:23.176 --> 32:24.376
Thank you, Young Master.

32:31.672 --> 32:33.672
Whenever I was wounded
on the battlefield,

32:33.830 --> 32:36.310
what I feared most
was First Madam finding out

32:36.400 --> 32:38.070
and worrying herself sick.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.856
The medicine is ready.

32:59.070 --> 32:59.400
Here.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.070
I'll feed you.

33:01.110 --> 33:02.880
Medicine isn't meant to taste good.

33:03.160 --> 33:04.790
It's best to drink it all at once.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.400
Taking it sip by sip

33:07.030 --> 33:08.830
only makes me savor the bitterness.

33:12.880 --> 33:13.640
Careful. It's hot.

33:13.960 --> 33:14.750
Bitter, isn't it?

33:24.510 --> 33:25.270
Don't worry.

33:25.510 --> 33:27.310
Only Gantang and I
know what really happened.

33:27.400 --> 33:29.000
None of the other maids know.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.790
With my skills,

33:30.830 --> 33:33.496
even if Xiaolian's mother came
to collect the night soil every day,

33:33.544 --> 33:35.030
she wouldn't hear a thing.

33:35.510 --> 33:36.880
Thank you, Yuchan.

33:37.750 --> 33:39.510
You've truly been
a great help this time.

33:39.592 --> 33:41.310
Sleep while the medicine
is taking effect.

33:41.310 --> 33:42.310
You'll heal faster.

33:43.680 --> 33:44.350
Just sleep.

33:53.460 --> 33:54.780
(Sanjue Hall)

33:54.790 --> 33:57.920
You didn't see that needle go in.

33:58.030 --> 33:59.832
You have no idea
how fierce Lanxiang was.

33:59.920 --> 34:00.720
I know.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.000
I saw it in her eyes.

34:04.200 --> 34:06.310
Once, when we
were surrounded by Wo pirates,

34:08.360 --> 34:10.320
Young Master
had that same look in his eyes.

34:13.280 --> 34:14.440
What kind of look?

34:16.840 --> 34:18.230
A fierce look

34:19.480 --> 34:20.880
that said he had to survive.

34:30.030 --> 34:30.840
Young Master.

34:32.110 --> 34:32.760
Young Master.

34:33.110 --> 34:33.550
Sit.

34:34.104 --> 34:36.456
Did you get the statements
from those four servants?

34:36.710 --> 34:37.510
Yes.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.320
There wasn't a single useful lead.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.960
They're thugs from Yangzhou

34:41.440 --> 34:42.510
who know how to fight.

34:42.856 --> 34:44.248
Lu Dalang paid them well

34:44.312 --> 34:45.400
to guard the residence.

34:45.760 --> 34:47.000
Whatever they knew,

34:47.150 --> 34:48.440
we already knew.

34:50.630 --> 34:52.590
That woman was bought by Lu Dalang

34:53.110 --> 34:54.400
from a brokerage house in Suzhou.

34:55.030 --> 34:57.360
She knew even less
than those four hired thugs.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.800
With Lu Dalang dead,

35:02.110 --> 35:04.230
we've lost every lead.

35:11.400 --> 35:13.590
I know Lu Dalang's true identity.

35:17.360 --> 35:20.800
Lu Dalang was from the Wo country.

35:25.320 --> 35:27.240
No wonder he had
calluses between his toes.

35:27.576 --> 35:29.112
The Wo people often wear wooden clogs.

35:29.912 --> 35:31.320
When Lu Dalang took his own life,

35:31.630 --> 35:32.630
the way he held the blade

35:32.630 --> 35:34.540
looked more like a Wo pirate
committing ritual suicide.

35:34.550 --> 35:36.024
He only changed his grip afterward.

35:36.190 --> 35:37.480
With just those two clues,

35:37.640 --> 35:39.112
aren't we jumping to conclusions?

35:40.510 --> 35:43.150
He was unusually greedy for cotton.

35:43.760 --> 35:45.360
Lanxiang lured him with cotton,

35:45.590 --> 35:46.920
and he walked right into the trap.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.760
It's already mid-spring.

35:49.920 --> 35:51.800
Even if the cotton were shipped north,

35:52.000 --> 35:53.030
it wouldn't be worth much.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.710
Unless there was somewhere

35:55.630 --> 35:57.880
that needed cotton
regardless of the season.

35:59.510 --> 36:00.360
Wo country.

36:02.440 --> 36:03.400
In the previous dynasty,

36:03.710 --> 36:05.190
cotton was a rarity.

36:05.288 --> 36:07.360
Only after the late Emperor
promoted its cultivation

36:07.590 --> 36:09.760
did the prices of cotton
and cotton cloth come down.

36:10.400 --> 36:13.150
But cotton remains scarce in Wo country.

36:13.360 --> 36:14.630
If smuggled there,

36:14.712 --> 36:16.312
it can yield several times the profit.

36:16.550 --> 36:18.400
But the late Emperor
imposed a maritime ban,

36:18.920 --> 36:21.400
so the Wo people
cannot purchase it openly.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.360
So he was from the Wo country.

36:24.590 --> 36:26.710
This case isn't
about embezzlement or bribery

36:26.710 --> 36:27.670
for petty profit.

36:28.920 --> 36:31.320
Officials at court
are colluding with the Wo people.

36:31.630 --> 36:32.800
defying the Emperor's will

36:32.904 --> 36:34.616
and engaging in illegal smuggling.

36:34.824 --> 36:35.860
(Map of Nanzhi County)

36:37.630 --> 36:38.480
Lanxiang surmised

36:38.568 --> 36:40.904
that Lu Dalang was about to move
within a day or two.

36:41.320 --> 36:43.110
And when he heard Lanxiang had cotton,

36:43.110 --> 36:44.230
he was eager to see it.

36:44.760 --> 36:46.230
Lanxiang's deduction should be right.

36:46.280 --> 36:47.704
But he wasn't preparing to move.

36:48.030 --> 36:50.360
Lu Dalang's cotton is about
to be shipped out of Jinling

36:50.670 --> 36:51.670
within a day or two.

36:52.900 --> 36:54.260
(Wo Country)

36:56.190 --> 36:58.150
Nanke and I will investigate right away.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.550
We'll stop both the shipment and the men

37:00.710 --> 37:01.960
before they leave Jinling.

37:03.032 --> 37:04.824
While we're away from you, Young Master,

37:04.880 --> 37:06.510
don't go out for the next two days.

37:07.080 --> 37:08.488
I've already made arrangements.

37:08.630 --> 37:09.440
As for you two,

37:09.710 --> 37:10.550
be extremely careful.

37:12.232 --> 37:13.176
- Yes.
- Yes.

37:29.224 --> 37:31.190
I hope you can live
better lives than before.

37:31.190 --> 37:31.920
This is Jinling, the Southern Capital.

37:31.920 --> 37:33.280
Wait for the right moment
to make a move.

37:33.280 --> 37:33.710
What's there to be afraid of?

37:33.710 --> 37:34.360
Become free commoners.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.840
Aren't you afraid?

37:40.110 --> 37:40.920
What's wrong?

37:45.630 --> 37:46.960
Does your wound hurt?

37:48.880 --> 37:50.280
I had a nightmare.

37:51.190 --> 37:52.190
It startled me awake.

37:54.630 --> 37:55.768
What did you dream about?

37:57.840 --> 37:58.710
I dreamed

38:00.000 --> 38:02.800
that man was swinging his blade wildly.

38:04.000 --> 38:05.280
There was blood everywhere.

38:06.480 --> 38:07.280
And...

38:08.000 --> 38:09.590
my family's bodies.

38:22.712 --> 38:24.190
Anyone who saw blood during the day

38:24.510 --> 38:26.190
would have nightmares at night.

38:27.960 --> 38:28.760
Don't be afraid.

38:29.190 --> 38:30.400
Dreams mean the opposite.

38:32.280 --> 38:34.230
When the blade was held to my throat,

38:36.070 --> 38:39.070
I was terrified
and regretted what I'd done.

38:41.280 --> 38:42.960
If I hadn't stepped in,

38:43.960 --> 38:46.480
I wouldn't have ended up in such danger.

38:49.110 --> 38:50.510
If I had died,

38:52.030 --> 38:53.800
my father and mother

38:54.840 --> 38:56.400
would never have been able to go on.

38:57.976 --> 38:59.800
I wouldn't
just have gotten myself killed.

39:01.230 --> 39:02.800
I would've cost them their lives, too.

39:16.110 --> 39:17.070
There's something

39:17.816 --> 39:19.670
I've wanted to tell you for a long time,

39:20.190 --> 39:22.190
but I've always
been too embarrassed to say it.

39:25.190 --> 39:28.590
My life is different
from yours and Xiaolian's.

39:29.960 --> 39:31.070
You don't have to say it.

39:31.128 --> 39:32.888
You're your parents' precious daughter.

39:33.512 --> 39:35.000
Xiaolian may have an older brother,

39:35.360 --> 39:38.400
but her grandmother
and mother both cherish her.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.190
I'm the second child in my family.

39:43.400 --> 39:45.510
I have an older brother

39:46.150 --> 39:48.190
and a younger brother.

39:49.400 --> 39:50.480
Ever since I was little,

39:50.744 --> 39:52.808
my parents have always
favored my brothers.

39:53.800 --> 39:54.590
Some time ago,

39:54.696 --> 39:56.920
my mother was arranging
a marriage for my older brother,

39:57.112 --> 39:59.384
but our family
couldn't afford the betrothal gifts.

39:59.800 --> 40:01.760
So my parents wanted

40:01.760 --> 40:03.528
to arrange my marriage
as soon as possible

40:03.800 --> 40:05.070
and use my betrothal gifts

40:06.400 --> 40:07.510
for my older brother.

40:09.000 --> 40:10.110
They called it a betrothal,

40:11.128 --> 40:13.208
but they were
really selling their daughter.

40:14.408 --> 40:15.670
They didn't care who it was,

40:16.000 --> 40:17.150
as long as he paid enough.

40:19.630 --> 40:21.000
Luckily, on the Festival of Man,

40:21.190 --> 40:22.960
I somehow followed your lead

40:23.176 --> 40:24.600
and ended up earning some merit.

40:24.880 --> 40:28.000
First Madam rewarded me
with ten taels of silver,

40:28.190 --> 40:28.880
and Young Master

40:29.110 --> 40:30.510
rewarded me with five taels.

40:30.616 --> 40:32.904
That was enough to cover
my brother's betrothal gifts.

40:34.190 --> 40:36.710
Only then did my mother agree

40:39.000 --> 40:41.440
not to rush me into a marriage.

40:47.360 --> 40:48.510
If you hadn't

40:49.510 --> 40:50.590
stepped in that day,

40:53.280 --> 40:54.590
my whole life

40:55.280 --> 40:56.190
would've been ruined.

40:57.670 --> 40:58.800
Completely ruined.

41:10.800 --> 41:11.590
Lanxiang,

41:13.590 --> 41:16.110
we're at the very bottom.

41:18.070 --> 41:19.400
If we don't take risks ourselves

41:19.590 --> 41:21.110
and fight for a way out,

41:21.550 --> 41:23.550
we'll remain
at the bottom all our lives.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.800
To everyone else,

41:26.400 --> 41:27.920
even to our own parents,

41:29.070 --> 41:31.360
we're only useful
for getting their sons wives.

41:32.480 --> 41:33.880
It was because you stepped in

41:35.000 --> 41:36.670
that you saved Young Master's marriage,

41:37.800 --> 41:39.480
saved the Lin family's reputation,

41:41.760 --> 41:42.920
and saved me, too.

41:43.570 --> 41:48.220
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

41:48.670 --> 41:52.790
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

41:53.230 --> 41:54.910
♪I've searched and searched♪

41:55.110 --> 41:56.110
Don't be sad anymore.

41:56.760 --> 41:58.760
I'll stay and sleep beside you tonight.

41:59.000 --> 41:59.800
All right?

41:59.800 --> 42:02.000
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

42:02.000 --> 42:02.550
Come.

42:02.730 --> 42:07.120
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

42:07.570 --> 42:12.810
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

42:13.200 --> 42:20.920
♪I only pray
that fate lets us meet sooner♪

42:20.960 --> 42:22.000
Get some sleep.

42:22.550 --> 42:24.550
If that bad man
comes back to torment you

42:24.550 --> 42:26.110
in your dreams tonight,

42:26.550 --> 42:27.590
call me and I'll help you.

42:27.800 --> 42:30.000
We'll spit right in his face together.

42:37.510 --> 42:39.800
We must live our lives with dignity.

42:40.800 --> 42:41.630
We're not afraid of

42:41.630 --> 42:43.752
an evil spirit that
can't even face the light of day.

43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.904 --> 43:12.696
Where did Yuchan and Lanxiang go?

43:14.110 --> 43:15.230
They're still not back?

43:15.448 --> 43:17.464
Marquis Yongchang
was afraid word might get out,

43:17.710 --> 43:18.920
so he had Yuchan and Lanxiang

43:18.920 --> 43:20.030
taken to the Naval Camp.

43:20.408 --> 43:23.032
I thought after we caught
the Wo pirates last night,

43:23.040 --> 43:25.400
Marquis Yongchang would send
someone to bring them back.

43:26.320 --> 43:28.216
Could Marquis Yongchang
have simply forgotten

43:28.480 --> 43:30.280
about Yuchan and Lanxiang?

43:30.408 --> 43:32.360
Yuchan has never
been inside a military camp.

43:32.590 --> 43:33.670
Being kept there all night

43:33.670 --> 43:34.984
must have frightened her badly.

43:35.510 --> 43:36.230
No.

43:36.344 --> 43:38.328
I have to go to the Naval Camp
and bring her back.

43:39.320 --> 43:39.880
Stop.

43:41.760 --> 43:42.760
I'll go with you.

43:43.432 --> 43:44.070
Young Master.

43:59.300 --> 44:03.420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:06.260 --> 44:10.780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:12.060 --> 44:15.980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:16.660 --> 44:19.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:20.140 --> 44:22.460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:22.460 --> 44:25.540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:27.060 --> 44:31.300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:34.220 --> 44:38.380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:40.180 --> 44:43.740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:43.740 --> 44:47.300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:48.100 --> 44:53.780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:54.140 --> 44:58.460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:58.820 --> 45:01.780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:01.780 --> 45:05.540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:05.540 --> 45:08.420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:08.420 --> 45:12.500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:12.500 --> 45:15.860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:15.860 --> 45:19.620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:19.620 --> 45:23.620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:24.380 --> 45:28.540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:28.540 --> 45:31.980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:31.980 --> 45:35.620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:35.620 --> 45:38.500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:38.500 --> 45:42.580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:42.580 --> 45:45.940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:45.940 --> 45:49.580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:49.580 --> 45:57.380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
